    "body": "The ViModeChangeHandlers needs to be a script block. AFAIK there isn't a good way to to join scriptblocks without concatenating them this way. I'll ask around though just to be certain.\r\n\r\nDo you have a specific concern? I suspect this is more of an edge case then not. And the resource cost would be minimal since it would only happen once at profile load. The stringification does not mean it's interpolated.",
